  "body": "Offering a more private position within the exclusive Camwell Shores development, Home 4 has been designed for buyers seeking a refined, low-maintenance coastal home with comfort, privacy and long-term ease. With a working lift, three ensuite bedrooms, beautiful sea views and valuable additional parking, this home is particularly well suited to downsizers, professional couples or smaller households wanting quality without compromise.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 175sqm across three levels, the layout is both elegant and highly practical.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, a private bedroom with its own fully tiled ensuite provides an ideal space for guests or family. A full designer laundry with stone benchtop and a single internal-access garage with generous storage add everyday convenience, while a dedicated off-street park positioned beside the garage entrance provides valuable extra parking — a major advantage for owners and guests alike.\r\n\r\nThe middle level forms the social heart of the home, with a beautifully appointed designer kitchen featuring premium Fisher & Paykel appliances, sleek cabinetry and a large island flowing into open-plan dining and living spaces. Outdoor living extends to both sides of the home, including a sea-facing balcony framed by a black timber pergola and a very large sun-soaked deck on the opposite side — perfect for BBQs, outdoor dining and relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nFront door access is from Camwell Close directly onto the main living level, creating an easy and welcoming arrival. Guests can park along the quiet street, then walk through the landscaping and across the sunny deck to the entrance.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home offers a particularly appealing arrangement of two bedrooms, each with its own ensuite. The master suite is the standout, with a generous walk-in wardrobe, fully tiled ensuite and a beautiful outlook across the sea. Together with the ensuite bedroom on the ground floor, all three bedrooms enjoy the privacy of their own bathroom.\r\n\r\nFinished in a premium combination of San Selmo Verona brick and black Nu-Wall aluminium cladding, Home 4 combines strong architectural character with durability and easy-care coastal living. A working lift connecting all three levels further enhances its appeal for buyers seeking convenience and future flexibility.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n-Approximately 175sqm floor area\r\n-More private position within Camwell Shores\r\n-Three bedrooms, each with its own ensuite\r\n-3.5 bathrooms including middle-floor powder room\r\n-Working lift connecting all three levels\r\n-Master suite with large walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and sea views\r\n-Ground-floor bedroom with fully tiled ensuite\r\n-Full designer laundry with stone benchtop\r\n-Single internal-access garage with generous storage\r\n-Dedicated off-street park beside the garage entrance\r\n-Designer kitchen with premium Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n-Large kitchen island and open-plan living\r\n-Sea-facing balcony with coastal outlook\r\n-Architectural black timber pergola\r\n-Very large sun-soaked deck ideal for BBQs and entertaining\r\n-Fully tiled bathrooms with rainfall showers\r\n-Central air conditioning\r\n-Premium San Selmo Verona brick\r\n-Black Nu-Wall aluminium cladding\r\n-Short walk to Bucklands Beach and Howick Golf Club\r\n-Stamford 10-year Building Warranty\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact the Urban Haus team.\r\n\r\nFor new releases, project updates and behind-the-scenes content, follow @urbanhausnz on Instagram and Facebook.",
